WEBVTT

00:39:55.996 --> 00:40:00.288
and really read about what's happening
to the environment and to society

00:40:00.829 --> 00:40:07.913
and not feel depressed. I defy anybody
with any kind of intelligence not to feel

00:40:07.913 --> 00:40:14.746
depressed, but when I get those feelings,
something pops up in me to say, well,

00:40:14.996 --> 00:40:18.829
I'm not going to be browbeaten
by this. I just won't.

00:40:18.829 --> 00:40:22.246
I suppose I was a born fighter.
Maybe it's my genes.

00:40:22.246 --> 00:40:25.663
I had an amazing grandmother,
an incredible mother.

00:40:26.288 --> 00:40:30.413
I think that's such a heartening message
to say I will not be browbeaten by this.